"OLAYLAR_ORTACAG_IBERYA_MAGRIB:0972-01-01:0":{"b": ["The Fatimid caliph al-Mu'izz appointed Buluggin governor of the Maghrib and settled him in Kairouan; the Zirid period began", "562089c8"], "d": ["The Fatimid Caliph al-Mu'izz li-Din Allah appointed Buluggin b. Ziri to the governorship of the Maghrib and settled him in Kairouan (361/972), and left the region after transferring the administrative centre of the state to Egypt.", "26bbc5b2"]},
